        "func": "// Prepare notification message\n// Works with BOTH node-red-dashboard v2 (ui_notification)\n// AND @flowfuse/node-red-dashboard v3 (ui-notification)\n// msg.payload must be a plain string for both versions\nif (msg.payload && msg.payload.message) {\n    msg.payload = msg.payload.message;\n}\nmsg.topic = 'Facade Joint Alert';\nreturn msg;\n",
